#: desc: Grouped targets are displayed with a & (also for double-colon rules)
-v COLOR=0 test/fixtures/Makefile.targets-grouped
#: stdout
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------

 ----- Independent Targets -----

first second           two targets
a b                    other two targets

 ----- Grouped Targets -----

me myself and I&       four grouped targets
the show must go on&   five grouped targets
lonely&                a bit pointless grouping one target

 ----- Double-colon grouped Targets -----

yes no&~1              two grouped targets with double-colon (recipe 1)
yes no&~2              two {`grouped`, `targets`, `with`, `double-colon`} (recipe 2)
yes no&~3              two grouped {targets} with double-colon (recipe 3)
-----------------------
